Welcome to the Hackclub Project for
Hackckub Terra! This was made initially as a
4 hour project with my teammates Yaseen and Luke (W ball knowledge)

You may need to download the Runtime Package of the engine to run the game:
https://www.rpgmakerweb.com/run-time-package


Controls:
Alt + Enter = fullscreen to make game go biiiiig
up arrow key to move up
down arrow key to move down
right arrow key to move right
left arrow key to move left

feedback appreciated:
If you ever feel a change to the game would be
an improvement to most players,
feel free to let me know!

this game was a really spur of the
moment choice to make.
All the story, character designs etc. were my idea.

I know this is a huge block of text, so thanks for reading!
